Adapted files (Sources/SmoothScroll/ScrollCore/):
  Interceptor.swift, ScrollCore.swift, ScrollDispatchContext.swift, ScrollEvent.swift,
  ScrollFilter.swift, ScrollPhase.swift, ScrollPoster.swift, ScrollUtils.swift

Changes: removed per-application profiles, custom hotkeys, button bindings, Logitech
HID++ support and debug diagnostics; scroll configuration is passed to the poster as a
snapshot; hotkeys are fixed to Mos defaults; the peak filter keeps only the two window
slots that are read (output unchanged).

Default scroll parameters (step 33.6, speed 2.70, duration 4.35, dead zone 1.0) are
taken from Mos.

